    "scope": "Specific Pyramid of the Sun exterior: five mapped sloping stages, horizontal terraces and flat summit; continuous west stair flights, landings and independently mapped projecting lower U-shaped platforms. No intact summit temple, individual stone inventory, visitors or hidden interiors. One ordinary photo viewed only;no redistributed pixels or bespoke research.",
