        "observations": "Broad rough-grey sloping pyramid with distinct stepped terrace breaks, central straight stair flights with side cheeks and intermediate landings, a projecting lower stair/platform range, narrow flat summit and low foreground retaining walls. No complete summit temple. Fine masonry, individual loose stones, people and precise historic reconstruction are outside the principal medium-fi scope."
